      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pharmacological experiments with cacao and avocado proanthocyanidins were performed. Analgesic action was measured by the heated plate method: mice receiving 80mg/kg of the drugs showed a behaviour similar to those receiving morphine. Potentiation of \"sleeping time\" suggests a possible depressive action on the central nervous system."},
